{"availability":"available","full":"awslabs/threat-composer","name":"threat-composer","description":"A simple threat modeling tool to help humans to reduce time-to-value when threat modeling","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":787,"forks":126,"created":"2023-04-24T01:07:44Z","updated":"2026-09-23T18:08:24Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://awslabs.github.io/threat-composer/","topics":["threat-modeling","threat-modeling-tool","threat-modelling-tool","threatmodeling","threatmodelling","vscode-extension"],"demo":"https://awslabs.github.io/threat-composer","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:41.776Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:41.776Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:41.776Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:41.776Z","stars":787,"forks":126}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An ecosystem of threat modeling tools to help humans reduce time-to-value when threat modeling.","Threat Composer is a threat modeling ecosystem that helps you identify security issues and develop strategies to address them in the context of your system. The various tools has been designed to support the iterative and non-linear nature of real-world threat modeling."],"features":["Helps you get started quickly - The AI-assisted CLI and MCP Server analyze your source code to generate a starter threat model, so you never face a blank page. Human expertise and participation remain essential to…","Makes threat identification easier - Uses \"Threat Grammar\" to help you iteratively write useful threats, with full examples for inspiration","Provides quality insights - Includes an insights dashboard to help identify areas for improvement","Supports non-linear workflows - Designed for how threat modeling actually works in practice","Enables iteration - Supports \"living\" threat models that evolve with your system"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awslabs/threat-composer/b